            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The capacity of the pellet extruder (output = 1250 kg/h) fits the need better than edge mills which would have higher output per machine weight. The life time of the infrastructure is assumed as 50 years (machines are replaced once in this time). The life time output is 1E8 m3 pellets. This data must only be used to consider the infrastructure needed for pelletising wood if this is not relevant.;
Synonyms: Pelletierpresse, Kolbenstrangpresse, extruder; 
UUID: b0b2bbd8-a529-32b9-948b-075b6eec4227</common:generalComment>
