            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Pellet extruder\n\n# Included processes\nThe material (production and disposal) and their transports needed for a wood pellet manufacturing machine in a sawmill. Land used is only included for the hall in which the process is run and the pellets are stored as the rest is already included in the sawmill.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
